Getsome wrote:
> I'm having a hard time figuring out the weapon charts
> http://www.steelypips.org/nethack/341/weap-341.html
> It would seem that only a Quarterstaff & a Dagger are good weapons for a 
> Wizard?
> What weapon should I be looking for? 

You should prefer spellcasting to melee with weapons; use attack spells.
Then you can also collect daggers to throw them in case your mana points
are low. Finally, the wizards first artifact weapon, Magicbane, is good.
I think that enhancing your staff proficiency might be a waste of slots
that you'll want to invest in enhancing your spellcasting capabilities.

